{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The eerie quiet of a cursed village conceals something far darker than myths in the first-person psychological horror game TheVillage: Possession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a failed demon-summoning ritual in your past, you play as a tormented protagonist who returns to their hometown of childhood, which has long been deserted. Now, if you finish their perverted &quot;tasks,&quot; the demons will whisper promises of freedom. However, the reality is more sinister: they want you and don't want to go.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927590?t=1760155043","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927590/e3a782be50c8a6b63557737af2f6a4e3a4fb33d2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760155043","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927590/531dd37fa3d888f922068b653702d9868678f622/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760155043","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927590/531dd37fa3d888f922068b653702d9868678f622/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760155043","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3971960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>ANNOUNCEMENT</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With pride, GlitchMind Games presents \ud83c\udfae The Village: Possession will soon be available on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They never lifted the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You believed the ceremony was unsuccessful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But a response came.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It wants your body now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it through the trick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, keep in mind that not all dead people remain buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f The first installment of the Village Chronicles series \ud83d\udc7b Demonic lore | psychological horror | puzzle-based survival \ud83d\udd79 Make a wish list now and, if you dare, confront your past.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The eerie quiet of a cursed village conceals something far darker than myths in the first-person psychological horror game TheVillage: Possession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a failed demon-summoning ritual in your past, you play as a tormented protagonist who returns to their hometown of childhood, which has long been deserted. Now, if you finish their perverted &quot;tasks,&quot; the demons will whisper promises of freedom. However, the reality is more sinister: they want you and don't want to go.</p>","developers":["GlitchMind Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927590/108911a2ec7dc0a6de76f13d9ab902261ded92a8/header.jpg?t=1760155043","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3927590/235022573/1beb94e5575f467ff9b9cfffb3153c185537a876/1760154668/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760155040","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/st